      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "a section in the radial menu with multiple emergency functions would be nice, like: go home, respawn, rejoin (and maybe: safety mode and reset avatar)\nto prevent accidental use they could have a confirmation sub menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-02-20T00:51:28.588Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes while hopping around random worlds you can end up in a world that is broken or lacks a floor and start falling forever. While falling it is close to impossible to use your menus to leave the world and if you manage to press go home on your quick menu it will be locked in place and you will fall away from you.\nI would love if there was some way to navigate to a go home menu with a radial menu or something that is controlled without pointing so in a situation you cannot stop moving its possible to leave a broken would without quitting the game entirely.\nPossibly while in safe mode have an extra radial option that you can get to with your joystick so its not able to be accidentally hit while playing",
